ilment</data></edge><node id="t:命題列"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">命題列</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L619:C0" target="t:命題列" id="e1588"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L619:C0" target="t:注解" id="e1589"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L619:C0" target="f:として" id="e1590"><data key="relation">literal_expression_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L621:C0"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">A.5　哲学者名は、本文の骨格ではない。</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L621:C0</data><data key="split">register</data></node><node id="t:哲学者名"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">哲学者名</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L621:C0" target="t:哲学者名" id="e1591"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L621:C0" target="t:本文" id="e1592"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:骨格"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">骨格</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L621:C0" target="t:骨格" id="e1593"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L621:C0" target="f:ではない" id="e1594"><data key="relation">literal_expression_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L623:C0"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">A.6　本文の骨格は、境界・履歴・内部ヒューリスティック・外部ヒューリスティック・同期・照合・残差保持である。</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L623:C0</data><data key="split">register</data></node><edge source="s:SAT:L623:C0" target="t:本文" id="e1595"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L623:C0" target="t:骨格" id="e1596"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L623:C0" target="t:境界" id="e1597"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L623:C0" target="t:履歴" id="e1598"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L623:C0" target="t:内部" id="e1599"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L623:C0" target="t:ヒューリスティック" id="e1600"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L623:C0" target="t:外部" id="e1601"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L623:C0" target="t:同期" id="e1602"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L623:C0" target="t:照合" id="e1603"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L623:C0" target="t:残差保持" id="e1604"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L623:C0" target="f:である" id="e1605"><data key="relation">literal_expression_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L631:C0"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">定義語: **Boundary Epistemological Critique**</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L631:C0</data><data key="split">register</data></node><node id="t:定義語"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">定義語</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L631:C0" target="t:定義語" id="e1606"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:Boundary"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">Boundary</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L631:C0" target="t:Boundary" id="e1607"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:Epistemological"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">Epistemological</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L631:C0" target="t:Epistemological" id="e1608"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:Critique"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">Critique</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L631:C0" target="t:Critique" id="e1609"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L632:C0"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">短縮候補: **Boundary Critique**</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L632:C0</data><data key="split">register</data></node><node id="t:短縮候補"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">短縮候補</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L632:C0" target="t:短縮候補" id="e1610"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L632:C0" target="t:Boundary" id="e1611"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L632:C0" target="t:Critique" id="e1612"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L633:C0"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">説明句: **Critique of Boundary Cognition**</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L633:C0</data><data key="split">register</data></node><node id="t:説明句"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">説明句</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L633:C0" target="t:説明句" id="e1613"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L633:C0" target="t:Critique" id="e1614"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:of"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">of</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L633:C0" target="t:of" id="e1615"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L633:C0" target="t:Boundary" id="e1616"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:Cognition"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">Cognition</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L633:C0" target="t:Cognition" id="e1617"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L635:C0"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">注意: `Boundary Critique` は短く強いが、認識論的文脈が薄くなる。</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L635:C0</data><data key="split">tune</data></node><node id="t:注意"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">注意</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L635:C0" target="t:注意" id="e1618"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L635:C0" target="t:Boundary" id="e1619"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L635:C0" target="t:Critique" id="e1620"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:認識論的文脈"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">認識論的文脈</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L635:C0" target="t:認識論的文脈" id="e1621"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L635:C43"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">正式名称としては `Boundary Epistemological Critique` を推奨する。</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L635:C43</data><data key="split">tune</data></node><node id="t:正式名称"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">正式名称</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L635:C43" target="t:正式名称" id="e1622"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L635:C43" target="t:Boundary" id="e1623"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L635:C43" target="t:Epistemological" id="e1624"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L635:C43" target="t:Critique" id="e1625"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:推奨"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">推奨</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L635:C43" target="t:推奨" id="e1626"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L635:C43" target="f:として" id="e1627"><data key="relation">literal_expression_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L635:C94"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">`Boundary Epistemic Critique` も意味は通るが、英語表現としてはやや硬く、体系名としては `Epistemological` の方が安定する。</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L635:C94</data><data key="split">tune</data></node><edge source="s:SAT:L635:C94" target="t:Boundary" id="e1628"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:Epistemic"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">Epistemic</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L635:C94" target="t:Epistemic" id="e1629"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L635:C94" target="t:Critique" id="e1630"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L635:C94" target="t:意味" id="e1631"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:英語表現"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">英語表現</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L635:C94" target="t:英語表現" id="e1632"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:体系名"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">体系名</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L635:C94" target="t:体系名" id="e1633"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L635:C94" target="t:Epistemological" id="e1634"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L635:C94" target="t:安定" id="e1635"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L635:C94" target="f:として" id="e1636"><data key="relation">literal_expression_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L641:C0"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">定義語: **operational correspondence**</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L641:C0</data><data key="split">register</data></node><edge source="s:SAT:L641:C0" target="t:定義語" id="e1637"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:operational"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">operational</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L641:C0" target="t:operational" id="e1638"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:correspondence"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">correspondence</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L641:C0" target="t:correspondence" id="e1639"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L642:C0"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">併記候補: **synchronization**</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L642:C0</data><data key="split">register</data></node><node id="t:併記候補"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">併記候補</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L642:C0" target="t:併記候補" id="e1640"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:synchronization"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">synchronization</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L642:C0" target="t:synchronization" id="e1641"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L644:C0"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">注意: ここでいう同期は、単なる同時化ではない。</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L644:C0</data><data key="split">register</data></node><edge source="s:SAT:L644:C0" target="t:注意" id="e1642"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L644:C0" target="t:同期" id="e1643"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:同時化"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">同時化</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L644:C0" target="t:同時化" id="e1644"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L644:C0" target="f:ではない" id="e1645"><data key="relation">literal_expression_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L644:C24"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">物理的同期、通信的同期、社会的調整、制度的対応を含むため、初出では `operational correspondence` として説明し、必要に応じて `synchronization` を併記する。</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L644:C24</data><data key="split">test</data></node><node id="t:物理的同期"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">物理的同期</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L644:C24" target="t:物理的同期" id="e1646"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:通信的同期"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">通信的同期</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L644:C24" target="t:通信的同期" id="e1647"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:社会的調整"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">社会的調整</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L644:C24" target="t:社会的調整" id="e1648"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:制度的対応"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">制度的対応</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L644:C24" target="t:制度的対応" id="e1649"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:初出"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">初出</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L644:C24" target="t:初出" id="e1650"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L644:C24" target="t:operational" id="e1651"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L644:C24" target="t:correspondence" id="e1652"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L644:C24" target="t:説明" id="e1653"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L644:C24" target="t:必要" id="e1654"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L644:C24" target="t:synchronization" id="e1655"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:併記"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">併記</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L644:C24" target="t:併記" id="e1656"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L644:C24" target="f:として" id="e1657"><data key="relation">literal_expression_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L650:C0"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">定義語: **collation**</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L650:C0</data><data key="split">register</data></node><edge source="s:SAT:L650:C0" target="t:定義語" id="e1658"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:collation"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">collation</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L650:C0" target="t:collation" id="e1659"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L651:C0"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">説明句: **semantic collation / cross-checking / semantic comparison**</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L651:C0</data><data key="split">register</data></node><edge source="s:SAT:L651:C0" target="t:説明句" id="e1660"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:semantic"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">semantic</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L651:C0" target="t:semantic" id="e1661"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L651:C0" target="t:collation" id="e1662"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:cross-checking"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">cross-checking</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L651:C0" target="t:cross-checking" id="e1663"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:comparison"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">comparison</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L651:C0" target="t:comparison" id="e1664"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L653:C0"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">注意: `collation` は体系語として使いやすいが、一般読者にはやや硬い。</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L653:C0</data><data key="split">register</data></node><edge source="s:SAT:L653:C0" target="t:注意" id="e1665"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L653:C0" target="t:collation" id="e1666"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:体系語"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">体系語</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L653:C0" target="t:体系語" id="e1667"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:一般読者"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">一般読者</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L653:C0" target="t:一般読者" id="e1668"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L653:C0" target="f:として" id="e1669"><data key="relation">literal_expression_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L653:C41"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">初出では `semantic collation` とし、「同期の一致・不一致・残差が何を意味するかを読む操作」と説明する。</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L653:C41</data><data key="split">register</data></node><edge source="s:SAT:L653:C41" target="t:初出" id="e1670"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L653:C41" target="t:semantic" id="e1671"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L653:C41" target="t:collation" id="e1672"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L653:C41" target="t:同期" id="e1673"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L653:C41" target="t:一致" id="e1674"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L653:C41" target="t:不一致" id="e1675"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L653:C41" target="t:残差" id="e1676"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L653:C41" target="t:意味" id="e1677"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L653:C41" target="t:操作" id="e1678"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L653:C41" target="t:説明" id="e1679"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L653:C103"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">`verification` と訳すと、検証・確認に寄りすぎるため避ける。</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L653:C103</data><data key="split">register</data></node><node id="t:verification"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">verification</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L653:C103" target="t:verification" id="e1680"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:検証"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">検証</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L653:C103" target="t:検証" id="e1681"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:確認"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">確認</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L653:C103" target="t:確認" id="e1682"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L659:C0"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">定義語: **residual**</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L659:C0</data><data key="split">register</data></node><edge source="s:SAT:L659:C0" target="t:定義語" id="e1683"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:residual"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">residual</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L659:C0" target="t:residual" id="e1684"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L660:C0"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">説明句: **re-collatable residual / unresolved residual**</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L660:C0</data><data key="split">tune</data></node><edge source="s:SAT:L660:C0" target="t:説明句" id="e1685"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:re-collatable"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">re-collatable</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L660:C0" target="t:re-collatable" id="e1686"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L660:C0" target="t:residual" id="e1687"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:unresolved"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">unresolved</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L660:C0" target="t:unresolved" id="e1688"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L662:C0"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">注意: 残差は、同期・照合・分類・観測の過程で現れる、まだ再照合可能な差分である。</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L662:C0</data><data key="split">tune</data></node><edge source="s:SAT:L662:C0" target="t:注意" id="e1689"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L662:C0" target="t:残差" id="e1690"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L662:C0" target="t:同期" id="e1691"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L662:C0" target="t:照合" id="e1692"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L662:C0" target="t:分類" id="e1693"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L662:C0" target="t:観測" id="e1694"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L662:C0" target="t:過程" id="e1695"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L662:C0" target="t:再照合可能" id="e1696"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L662:C0" target="t:差分" id="e1697"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L662:C0" target="f:である" id="e1698"><data key="relation">literal_expression_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L662:C41"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">操作対象として扱える差分を指す場合は `residual` がよい。</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L662:C41</data><data key="split">register</data></node><node id="t:操作対象"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">操作対象</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L662:C41" target="t:操作対象" id="e1699"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L662:C41" target="t:差分" id="e1700"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L662:C41" target="t:場合" id="e1701"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L662:C41" target="t:residual" id="e1702"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L662:C41" target="f:として" id="e1703"><data key="relation">literal_expression_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="f:場合は"><data key="node_type">expression_candidate</data><data key="display">場合は</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L662:C41" target="f:場合は" id="e1704"><data key="relation">literal_expression_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L668:C0"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">定義語: **residue**</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L668:C0</data><data key="split">register</data></node><edge source="s:SAT:L668:C0" target="t:定義語" id="e1705"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:residue"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">residue</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L668:C0" target="t:residue" id="e1706"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L669:C0"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">強調候補: **sedimented residue**</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L669:C0</data><data key="split">tune</data></node><node id="t:強調候補"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">強調候補</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L669:C0" target="t:強調候補" id="e1707"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:sedimented"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">sedimented</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L669:C0" target="t:sedimented" id="e1708"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L669:C0" target="t:residue" id="e1709"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L671:C0"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">注意: 残渣は、処理・分類・制度化・交換・説明のあとに残り、しばしば不可視化されながらも場に作用し続ける履歴的沈殿である。</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L671:C0</data><data key="split">register</data></node><edge source="s:SAT:L671:C0" target="t:注意" id="e1710"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L671:C0" target="t:残渣" id="e1711"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L671:C0" target="t:処理" id="e1712"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L671:C0" target="t:分類" id="e1713"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L671:C0" target="t:制度化" id="e1714"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L671:C0" target="t:交換" id="e1715"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L671:C0" target="t:説明" id="e1716"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L671:C0" target="t:不可視化" id="e1717"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L671:C0" target="t:作用" id="e1718"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L671:C0" target="t:履歴的沈殿" id="e1719"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L671:C0" target="f:である" id="e1720"><data key="relation">literal_expression_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L671:C61"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">環境負荷、制度外負債、身体化した違和感、搾取の残りを含む場合は `residue` または `sedimented residue` がよい。</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L671:C61</data><data key="split">register</data></node><node id="t:環境負荷"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">環境負荷</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L671:C61" target="t:環境負荷" id="e1721"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:制度外負債"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">制度外負債</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L671:C61" target="t:制度外負債" id="e1722"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:身体化"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">身体化</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L671:C61" target="t:身体化" id="e1723"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L671:C61" target="t:違和感" id="e1724"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L671:C61" target="t:搾取" id="e1725"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L671:C61" target="t:場合" id="e1726"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L671:C61" target="t:residue" id="e1727"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L671:C61" target="t:sedimented" id="e1728"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L671:C61" target="f:場合は" id="e1729"><data key="relation">literal_expression_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L673:C0"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">補足: 「純虚成分」として扱う場合でも、英語本文ではいきなり `pure imaginary component` と訳さない方がよい。</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L673:C0</data><data key="split">test</data></node><node id="t:補足"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">補足</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L673:C0" target="t:補足" id="e1730"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:純虚成分"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">純虚成分</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L673:C0" target="t:純虚成分" id="e1731"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L673:C0" target="t:場合" id="e1732"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:英語本文"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">英語本文</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L673:C0" target="t:英語本文" id="e1733"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:pure"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">pure</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L673:C0" target="t:pure" id="e1734"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:imaginary"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">imaginary</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L673:C0" target="t:imaginary" id="e1735"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:component"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">component</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L673:C0" target="t:component" id="e1736"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L673:C0" target="f:として" id="e1737"><data key="relation">literal_expression_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L673:C68"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">数理的定義をまだ与えていない段階では、`residue outside the current operational frame` 程度に留める。</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L673:C68</data><data key="split">register</data></node><node id="t:数理的定義"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">数理的定義</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L673:C68" target="t:数理的定義" id="e1738"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:段階"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">段階</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L673:C68" target="t:段階" id="e1739"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L673:C68" target="t:residue" id="e1740"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:outside"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">outside</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L673:C68" target="t:outside" id="e1741"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:the"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">the</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L673:C68" target="t:the" id="e1742"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:current"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">current</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L673:C68" target="t:current" id="e1743"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L673:C68" target="t:operational" id="e1744"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:frame"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">frame</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L673:C68" target="t:frame" id="e1745"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:程度"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">程度</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L673:C68" target="t:程度" id="e1746"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L679:C0"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">定義語: **history**</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L679:C0</data><data key="split">register</data></node><edge source="s:SAT:L679:C0" target="t:定義語" id="e1747"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:history"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">history</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L679:C0" target="t:history" id="e1748"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L680:C0"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">強調候補: **accumulated history / history-bearing**</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L680:C0</data><data key="split">register</data></node><edge source="s:SAT:L680:C0" target="t:強調候補" id="e1749"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:accumulated"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">accumulated</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L680:C0" target="t:accumulated" id="e1750"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L680:C0" target="t:history" id="e1751"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:history-bearing"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">history-bearing</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L680:C0" target="t:history-bearing" id="e1752"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L682:C0"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">注意: ここでいう履歴は、単なる過去ではなく、次の受け取り方・反応・判断・意味づけを変える蓄積である。</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L682:C0</data><data key="split">register</data></node><edge source="s:SAT:L682:C0" target="t:注意" id="e1753"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L682:C0" target="t:履歴" id="e1754"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L682:C0" target="t:過去" id="e1755"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L682:C0" target="t:反応" id="e1756"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L682:C0" target="t:判断" id="e1757"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L682:C0" target="t:意味" id="e1758"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L682:C0" target="t:蓄積" id="e1759"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L682:C0" target="f:である" id="e1760"><data key="relation">literal_expression_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L682:C51"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">必要に応じて `history-bearing entity` や `history-bearing field` とする。</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L682:C51</data><data key="split">register</data></node><edge source="s:SAT:L682:C51" target="t:必要" id="e1761"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L682:C51" target="t:history-bearing" id="e1762"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:entity"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">entity</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L682:C51" target="t:entity" id="e1763"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:field"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">field</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L682:C51" target="t:field" id="e1764"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L682:C51" target="f:とする" id="e1765"><data key="relation">literal_expression_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L688:C0"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">定義語: **history-field**</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L688:C0</data><data key="split">test</data></node><edge source="s:SAT:L688:C0" target="t:定義語" id="e1766"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:history-field"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">history-field</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L688:C0" target="t:history-field" id="e1767"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L689:C0"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">説明句: **history-bearing field**</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L689:C0</data><data key="split">register</data></node><edge source="s:SAT:L689:C0" target="t:説明句" id="e1768"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L689:C0" target="t:history-bearing" id="e1769"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L689:C0" target="t:field" id="e1770"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L691:C0"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">注意: `field` は物理場との混同を招きやすい。</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L691:C0</data><data key="split">register</data></node><edge source="s:SAT:L691:C0" target="t:注意" id="e1771"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L691:C0" target="t:field" id="e1772"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:物理場"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">物理場</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L691:C0" target="t:物理場" id="e1773"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:混同"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">混同</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L691:C0" target="t:混同" id="e1774"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L691:C27"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">初出では `history-field, or history-bearing field` と説明し、標準物理学の field と同一視しないことを明記する。</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L691:C27</data><data key="split">register</data></node><edge source="s:SAT:L691:C27" target="t:初出" id="e1775"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L691:C27" target="t:history-field" id="e1776"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:or"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">or</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L691:C27" target="t:or" id="e1777"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L691:C27" target="t:history-bearing" id="e1778"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L691:C27" target="t:field" id="e1779"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L691:C27" target="t:説明" id="e1780"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:標準物理学"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">標準物理学</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L691:C27" target="t:標準物理学" id="e1781"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:同一視"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">同一視</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L691:C27" target="t:同一視" id="e1782"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:明記"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">明記</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L691:C27" target="t:明記" id="e1783"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L697:C0"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">定義語: **internal heuristic / external heuristic**</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L697:C0</data><data key="split">register</data></node><edge source="s:SAT:L697:C0" target="t:定義語" id="e1784"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:internal"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">internal</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L697:C0" target="t:internal" id="e1785"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:heuristic"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">heuristic</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L697:C0" target="t:heuristic" id="e1786"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:external"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">external</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L697:C0" target="t:external" id="e1787"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L699:C0"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">注意: ここでいう `heuristic` は、単なる経験則ではない。</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L699:C0</data><data key="split">register</data></node><edge source="s:SAT:L699:C0" target="t:注意" id="e1788"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L699:C0" target="t:heuristic" id="e1789"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:経験則"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">経験則</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L699:C0" target="t:経験則" id="e1790"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L699:C0" target="f:ではない" id="e1791"><data key="relation">literal_expression_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L699:C35"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">履歴を原料として、受容・分類・判断・閉鎖・再照合を可能にする構造である。</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L699:C35</data><data key="split">register</data></node><edge source="s:SAT:L699:C35" target="t:履歴" id="e1792"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:原料"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">原料</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L699:C35" target="t:原料" id="e1793"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L699:C35" target="t:受容" id="e1794"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L699:C35" target="t:分類" id="e1795"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L699:C35" target="t:判断" id="e1796"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L699:C35" target="t:閉鎖" id="e1797"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L699:C35" target="t:再照合" id="e1798"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L699:C35" target="t:可能" id="e1799"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L699:C35" target="t:構造" id="e1800"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L699:C35" target="f:として" id="e1801"><data key="relation">literal_expression_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L699:C35" target="f:である" id="e1802"><data key="relation">literal_expression_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L701:C0"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">補足: false closure は、既存の closure に似た構造を借りて、未解決の gap を補完したように見せる操作である。</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L701:C0</data><data key="split">register</data></node><edge source="s:SAT:L701:C0" target="t:補足" id="e1803"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:false"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">false</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L701:C0" target="t:false" id="e1804"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:closure"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">closure</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L701:C0" target="t:closure" id="e1805"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L701:C0" target="t:既存" id="e1806"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L701:C0" target="t:構造" id="e1807"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L701:C0" target="t:未解決" id="e1808"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:gap"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">gap</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L701:C0" target="t:gap" id="e1809"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:補完"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">補完</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L701:C0" target="t:補完" id="e1810"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L701:C0" target="t:操作" id="e1811"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L701:C0" target="f:である" id="e1812"><data key="relation">literal_expression_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L701:C68"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">ただし、その補完は history-field を無視するため、残差または残渣へのアクセス経路を塞ぐ。</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L701:C68</data><data key="split">register</data></node><edge source="s:SAT:L701:C68" target="t:補完" id="e1813"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L701:C68" target="t:history-field" id="e1814"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:無視"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">無視</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L701:C68" target="t:無視" id="e1815"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L701:C68" target="t:残差" id="e1816"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L701:C68" target="t:残渣" id="e1817"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L701:C68" target="t:アクセス" id="e1818"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L701:C68" target="t:経路" id="e1819"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L701:C68" target="f:ただし" id="e1820"><data key="relation">literal_expression_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L707:C0"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">定義語: **capacity for judgment**</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L707:C0</data><data key="split">test</data></node><edge source="s:SAT:L707:C0" target="t:定義語" id="e1821"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:capacity"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">capacity</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L707:C0" target="t:capacity" id="e1822"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:for"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">for</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L707:C0" target="t:for" id="e1823"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:judgment"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">judgment</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L707:C0" target="t:judgment" id="e1824"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L708:C0"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">文脈候補: **room for judgment / conditions for judgment**</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L708:C0</data><data key="split">register</data></node><node id="t:文脈候補"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">文脈候補</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L708:C0" target="t:文脈候補" id="e1825"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:room"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">room</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L708:C0" target="t:room" id="e1826"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L708:C0" target="t:for" id="e1827"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><edge source="s:SAT:L708:C0" target="t:judgment" id="e1828"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:conditions"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">conditions</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L708:C0" target="t:conditions" id="e1829"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L710:C0"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">注意: `judgment-possibility` は硬い。</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L710:C0</data><data key="split">register</data></node><edge source="s:SAT:L710:C0" target="t:注意" id="e1830"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="t:judgment-possibility"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">judgment-possibility</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L710:C0" target="t:judgment-possibility" id="e1831"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L710:C31"><data key="node_type">sentence</data><data key="display">本人の能力を強調する場合は `capacity for judgment`、判断の余地・場・条件を強調する場合は `room for judgment` または `conditions for judgment` がよい。</data><data key="source_anchor">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L710:C31</data><data key="split">register</data></node><node id="t:本人"><data key="node_type">term_candidate</data><data key="display">本人</data><data key="source_anchor" /><data key="split" /></node><edge source="s:SAT:L710:C31" target="t:本人" id="e1832"><data key="relation">literal_term_use_not_entailment</d